not nominated by us or taking other corporate actions, including effecting changes in our management. See &#8220;Item 10. Additional
Information&#8212;B. Memorandum and Articles of Association.&#8221; These provisions, alone or together, could delay or prevent
hostile takeovers and changes in control or changes in our board of directors or management.</span></p><div>

