</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Pursuant to a share swap agreement
dated November 5, 2020, VisionGain Ventures Limited (&#8220;VisionGain Ventures&#8221;), an offshore affiliate of the then shareholders
of You Service, subscribed for 4,666,667 Series C Preferred Shares, in consideration of which, the then shareholders of You Service transferred
