in 2023 to RMB126.7 million in 2024, primarily because RMB13.0 million of credit losses of other receivables and RMB2.4 million of credit
losses of accounts receivable were reversed in 2023 due to effective receivables collection but RMB1.6 million (US$0.2 million) credit
losses of other receivables were reversed and RMB1.8 million (US$0.3 million) credit losses of accounts receivable charged to expense
in 2024.</span></p><div>

