primarily due to our net profit of RMB79.3 million, as adjusted to reflect certain non-cash or non-operating activities related items,
which primarily included fair value gains from financial assets at fair value through profit or loss of RMB36.5 million. Changes in the
working capital mainly included (1) an increase of RMB140.8 million in trade receivables; (2) an increase in contract liability of RMB36.6
million; (3) an increase in other payables and accruals of RMB82.4 million; and (4) principle of lease payments of RMB8.1 million and
the net cash provided by operating activities from discontinued operations of RMB1.2 million.</span></p><div>

