    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the
    instrument of transfer is lodged at the registered office or such other place (i.e., our transfer agent) at which the register of
    shareholders is kept, accompanied by any relevant share certificate(s) and/or such other evidence as the board of directors may reasonably
    require to show the right of the transferor to make the transfer;</span></td></tr>
