<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On January 4, 2024, the Group acquired Ankang
Jiren Human Resources Service Co., Ltd., Hetian Tiankun Landing Human Resources Service Co., Ltd. and Shangluo Hesheng Human Resources
Co., Ltd. with total cash consideration of RMB <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c204" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="youl:CashConsideration" scale="3" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-30790">12,575</ix:nonFraction>, fully paid in 2024. The companies mentioned above were engaged in labor dispatch
services.</p>

