<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The fair value assessment for the acquisitions
was based on a valuation determined by the Group with the assistance of an independent third-party valuation firm. No goodwill is recognized
as the consideration is based on the net assets.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The results of operations of the acquired companies were included in
the consolidated statement of comprehensive loss from the acquisition date. Pro forma results of operations were not presented because
the effect of the acquisition was not material to the Group&#8217;s consolidated financial statements.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

